# A long train groups from the right; the note names the inner fork
# the element belongs to.
== SOURCE
[r_ev + a_bs n_ot t_ally] 1 2
== ERROR
error[type-mismatch]: expected Bool or Int, found Int -> a
 --> -e:1:14
  |
1 | [r_ev + a_bs n_ot t_ally] 1 2
  |              ^^^^
  |                   ------ `t_ally` always gives an Int
  = note: `n_ot` has type (Truthy a, Truthy b) => a -> b
  = note: in the train `[a_bs n_ot t_ally]`, `n_ot` is applied as `(a_bs x) n_ot (t_ally x)`, where x is the train's argument
  = note: `n_ot` takes one argument, but here it is given two
